EMPLOYEE MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

Main - application entry point

StorageController – Lets user choose storage type

MenuController – Displays role-based menu and navigation

AuthService - Handles login authentication,change password and first time login 

EmployeeService - business logic,validation and role based checks 

EmployeeDAO - Interface for employee operations

EmployeeJsonDAOImpl - File-based implementation using JSON

EmployeeJdbcDAOImpl - Database-based implementation using JDBC

Employee - employee entity and details 

enums - roles,menu,update,storage options

ConfigUtil – Reads application configuration values

DatabaseUtil – Manages database connection

PasswordUtil – Encrypts passwords using SHA-256

app.properties – Default admin details

db.properties – Database connection details

employees.json – File storage data
